  "description": "Cool paper with graded rungs. Every slide is one task written three times — weak, better, best — as three prompt cards stacked down the page, and the best one is broken out beside it into named parts. The escalation is the argument: the reader sees the gap rather than being told about it. Built for prompt, brief and spec teardowns where the improvement is the content. Animates: the rungs climb in order and the parts land last. Derived from the DcV609LCa84 reference deck.",
